  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDI/UPFI 09-14 - UPFI</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SDI/UPFI 09-14</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SDI &#xe4;r ett n&#xe4;tverk av nationella federationer av organiserade         slumboende (CBOs). UPFI sponsrar dessa fed&apos;s. SDI &#xe4;r troligen         l&#xe5;ngsiktigt Sidas mest strategiska partner inom slumf&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring.      Gemensamt arbete med exist. partners Gates o Norge. Se &#xe4;ven           PLUS54040079 f&#xf6;r kapacitetsf&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringsinsats.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDI-a &quot;transnat&apos;l network of local slum dweller org&apos;s who have come   together at the city and national level to form federations of the    urban poor&apos;. The fund UPFI sponsor these fed&apos;s. Sida&apos;s support to SDI is exceptionally strategic since it is a unique CBO working on key    issues. Joint work with existing UPFI-donors: Gates&amp;Norway. Parallel  capacity-building support to SDI: PLUS54040079</narrative>
  </description>
